rt numeric equality with the Then step's numeral), which resolves `3` vs `3.0` without further instruction.\n- `architecture.services[]` entry `calc`, including `public_interface` and both elements: unchanged.\n- `architecture.terms`: unchanged (stays `[]`).\n- `docs/product/product.yaml` in full: unchanged — no concept widened, no new variation added, no Story or Scenario wording touched. The Item host-001 text (\"6 is entered\" / \"halve once\" / \"3 is displayed\") stays as written.\n\nNo new concept variation is proposed: host-001 introduces no new item or use, and the existing `given`/`when`/`then` variations already cover this item and use, so widening would be unwarranted.\n","questions":[]}}}
